{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Warrior is an adventure, and platformer game that explores the perspective of multiple protagonists, all intertwined in a single, grand story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control multiple characters</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/multiple_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Each character wants to be the star of their own adventure. By taking control of each one, you'll discover that the villain and the hero are simply a matter of perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face challenges</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/puzzle_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>In addition to unique abilities, each character carries their own difficulties and obstacles. Overcoming them will require thinking outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/explore_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Dive into a universe full of details and secrets. Explore the environment, meet unique creatures, and decipher ancient runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make new friends</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/characters_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Encounter unique and charismatic characters throughout your journey and understand their motivations and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight colossal bosses</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/fight_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Terrifying creatures of unimaginable size await you underground. Defeating them won\u2019t be an easy task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the truth</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/truth_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Piece together fragments of the story from each character\u2019s perspective through dialogues and ancient ruins. Can you uncover the truth?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2411250?t=1751709153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751709153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751709153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751709153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Warrior is an adventure, and platformer game that explores the perspective of multiple protagonists, all intertwined in a single, grand story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Control multiple characters</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/multiple_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Each character wants to be the star of their own adventure. By taking control of each one, you'll discover that the villain and the hero are simply a matter of perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face challenges</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/puzzle_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>In addition to unique abilities, each character carries their own difficulties and obstacles. Overcoming them will require thinking outside the box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the world</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/explore_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Dive into a universe full of details and secrets. Explore the environment, meet unique creatures, and decipher ancient runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make new friends</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/characters_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Encounter unique and charismatic characters throughout your journey and understand their motivations and desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight colossal bosses</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/fight_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /></div>Terrifying creatures of unimaginable size await you underground. Defeating them won\u2019t be an easy task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover the truth</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411250/extras/truth_about.gif?t=1751709153\" /